#~ "aangepaste rollen te maken voor uitgebreide functionaliteit."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Assigning high-privilege capabilities directly to users or expanding the "
#~ "number of users in high-privilege roles increases the potential attack "
#~ "surface. This check identifies users with elevated access to ensure that "
#~ "roles and capabilities are properly managed, minimizing security risks."
